That's the short version. The full video also covers Picture a genuinely

50
00:02:07,277 --> 00:02:10,977
useful agent…, We spent an entire video… and So what actually helps?

51
00:02:11,410 --> 00:02:13,710
A… — watch The Agent That Was Told What To Do for

52
